      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHOOSING TEXAS (1) goes very well this trip starting 20 times for eight wins and seven minors. Scored by 0.8 lengths last time (29.72) in a Grade 5 over 520m at this track. With a clean break looks hard to beat. WEST ON SABRE (7) was quickly into stride on debut to score by 4.5 lengths (30.08) at this track over 520m. Drawn wide but has good early pace. Will break from the same draw this time. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. STAN MONELLI (6) is a talented type progressing through the grades and building a strong record. Has been on speed to score at his last couple of runs. Latest win recorded a handy 29.60 at this track. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Expected to feature again. TATTOOED BEAST (2) generally performs well here at this distance.",
